#### Layer 2: Mock Definition Management (Configuration as Code)

Mock definitions are declarative configurations (JSON, YAML) stored in Git repositories alongside application code and tests. This "Mocks as Code" approach enables version control, code review, and synchronization with service contracts.

**WireMock JSON Mapping Structure**:

```json
{
  "mappings": [
    {
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "urlPathPattern": "/api/eligibility/members/.*",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": {
            "matches": "Bearer .*"
          }
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "headers": {
          "Content-Type": "application/json"
        },
        "jsonBody": {
          "memberId": "M123456",
          "eligibilityStatus": "ACTIVE",
          "planCode": "MED-STD",
          "effectiveDate": "2025-01-01"
        },
        "fixedDelayMilliseconds": 100
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

**MockServer Expectation Structure** (programmatic JavaScript):

```javascript
mockServerClient("localhost", 1080).mockAnyResponse({
  "httpRequest": {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/api/claims/submit",
    "body": {
      "type": "JSON",
      "json": {
        "claimType": "PROFESSIONAL"
      }
    }
  },
  "httpResponse": {
    "statusCode": 201,
    "headers": {
      "Location": ["https://api.claims.example.com/claims/CLM-789"]
    },
    "body": JSON.stringify({
      "claimId": "CLM-789",
      "status": "SUBMITTED",
      "submittedAt": "2026-01-14T10:30:00Z"
    })
  },
  "times": {
    "remainingTimes": 1,
    "unlimited": false
  }
});
```

Mock definitions follow a structured repository organization:

```text
mocks/
├── state-eligibility-api/           # Mock for State Eligibility System
│   ├── mappings/
│   │   ├── member-eligibility-active.json
│   │   ├── member-eligibility-inactive.json
│   │   ├── member-not-found-404.json
│   │   └── service-unavailable-503.json
│   ├── __files/
│   │   ├── member-m123456-response.json
│   │   └── member-m789012-response.json
│   └── docker-compose.yml
├── caqh-proview-api/                # Mock for CAQH Provider Credentialing
│   ├── mappings/
│   │   ├── provider-credentialed.json
│   │   ├── provider-not-credentialed.json
│   │   └── api-timeout-scenario.json
│   └── docker-compose.yml
└── nppes-npi-lookup/                # Mock for NPPES NPI Registry
    ├── mappings/
    │   ├── npi-valid-lookup.json
    │   └── npi-invalid-404.json
    └── docker-compose.yml
```

