    "method": "GET",
    "urlPath": "/api/eligibility/slow"
  },
  "response": {
    "status": 200,
    "jsonBody": {
      "eligibilityStatus": "ACTIVE"
    },
    "fixedDelayMilliseconds": 5000
  }
}
```

**Random Delay Variation**:

```json
{
  "response": {
    "status": 200,
    "jsonBody": { "result": "success" },
    "delayDistribution": {
      "type": "lognormal",
      "median": 500,
      "sigma": 0.4
    }
  }
}
```

